Q375 -82 369 -68V230H70Q56 237 56 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-61\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-33\" x=\"748\" y=\"583\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"1205\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(2206,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-62\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-33\" x=\"607\" y=\"583\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"3367\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"4423\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-61\" x=\"4813\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"5565\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-62\" x=\"6565\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"6995\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"7384\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(7774,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-61\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"748\" y=\"583\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"8979\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-61\" x=\"9980\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-62\" x=\"10510\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2B\" x=\"11161\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(12162,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-62\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"607\" y=\"583\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"13045\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"13435\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Notice that we can write the given expression as a difference of cubes:</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"16.926ex\" height=\"2.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.505ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1006.6 7287.7 1223.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\nx^3 - 8 = x^3 - 2^3\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMATHI-78\" d=\"M52 289Q59 331 106 386T222 442Q257 442 286 424T329 379Q371 442 430 442Q467 442 494 420T522 361Q522 332 508 314T481 292T458 288Q439 288 427 299T415 328Q415 374 465 391Q454 404 425 404Q412 404 406 402Q368 386 350 336Q290 115 290 78Q290 50 306 38T341 26Q378 26 414 59T463 140Q466 150 469 151T485 153H489Q504 153 504 145Q504 144 502 134Q486 77 440 33T333 -11Q263 -11 227 52Q186 -10 133 -10H127Q78 -10 57 16T35 71Q35 103 54 123T99 143Q142 143 142 101Q142 81 130 66T107 46T94 41L91 40Q91 39 97 36T113 29T132 26Q168 26 194 71Q203 87 217 139T245 247T261 313Q266 340 266 352Q266 380 251 392T217 404Q177 404 142 372T93 290Q91 281 88 280T72 278H58Q52 284 52 289Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-33\" d=\"M127 463Q100 463 85 480T69 524Q69 579 117 622T233 665Q268 665 277 664Q351 652 390 611T430 522Q430 470 396 421T302 350L299 348Q299 347 308 345T337 336T375 315Q457 262 457 175Q457 96 395 37T238 -22Q158 -22 100 21T42 130Q42 158 60 175T105 193Q133 193 151 175T169 130Q169 119 166 110T159 94T148 82T136 74T126 70T118 67L114 66Q165 21 238 21Q293 21 321 74Q338 107 338 175V195Q338 290 274 322Q259 328 213 329L171 330L168 332Q166 335 166 348Q166 366 174 366Q202 366 232 371Q266 376 294 413T322 525V533Q322 590 287 612Q265 626 240 626Q208 626 181 615T143 592T132 580H135Q138 579 143 578T153 573T165 566T175 555T183 540T186 520Q186 498 172 481T127 463Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2212\" d=\"M84 237T84 250T98 270H679Q694 262 694 250T679 230H98Q84 237 84 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-38\" d=\"M70 417T70 494T124 618T248 666Q319 666 374 624T429 515Q429 485 418 459T392 417T361 389T335 371T324 363L338 354Q352 344 366 334T382 323Q457 264 457 174Q457 95 399 37T249 -22Q159 -22 101 29T43 155Q43 263 172 335L154 348Q133 361 127 368Q70 417 70 494ZM286 386L292 390Q298 394 301 396T311 403T323 413T334 425T345 438T355 454T364 471T369 491T371 513Q371 556 342 586T275 624Q268 625 242 625Q201 625 165 599T128 534Q128 511 141 492T167 463T217 431Q224 426 228 424L286 386ZM250 21Q308 21 350 55T392 137Q392 154 387 169T375 194T353 216T330 234T301 253T274 270Q260 279 244 289T218 306L210 311Q204 311 181 294T133 239T107 157Q107 98 150 60T250 21Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-33\" x=\"809\" y=\"583\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"1248\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-38\" x=\"2249\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"3027\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(4083,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-33\" x=\"809\" y=\"583\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"5332\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(6333,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-33\" x=\"707\" y=\"583\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Now, we factor the given expression using the difference of cubes formula:</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"34.348ex\" height=\"12.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -5.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -2944.1 14788.7 5385.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n\t\\eqalign{\nx^3 - 8 &amp; = x^3 - 2^3<span>\\</span>[3pt]\n\n&amp; = (x - 2)\\left(x^2 + 2\\cdot x + 2^2\\right)<span>\\</span>[3pt]\n\n&amp; = (x - 2)\\left(x^2 + 2x + 4\\right)\t\t\n\t}\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMATHI-78\" d=\"M52 289Q59 331 106 386T222 442Q257 442 286 424T329 379Q371 442 430 442Q467 442 494 420T522 361Q522 332 508 314T481 292T458 288Q439 288 427 299T415 328Q415 374 465 391Q454 404 425 404Q412 404 406 402Q368 386 350 336Q290 115 290 78Q290 50 306 38T341 26Q378 26 414 59T463 140Q466 150 469 151T485 153H489Q504 153 504 145Q504 144 502 134Q486 77 440 33T333 -11Q263 -11 227 52Q186 -10 133 -10H127Q78 -10 57 16T35 71Q35 103 54 123T99 143Q142 143 142 101Q142 81 130 66T107 46T94 41L91 40Q91 39 97 36T113 29T132 26Q168 26 194 71Q203 87 217 139T245 247T261 313Q266 340 266 352Q266 380 251 392T217 404Q177 404 142 372T93 290Q91 281 88 280T72 278H58Q52 284 52 289Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-33\" d=\"M127 463Q100 463 85 480T69 524Q69 579 117 622T233 665Q268 665 277 664Q351 652 390 611T430 522Q430 470 396 421T302 350L299 348Q299 347 308 345T337 336T375 315Q457 262 457 175Q457 96 395 37T238 -22Q158